{"availability":"available","full":"dcondrey/buildingforgood","name":"buildingforgood","description":"Decision-support demo for downtown San Diego outreach planning: audits what the unsheltered count actually measured, backtests a forecast honestly, and turns the evidence into an editable, human-owned staff-hour plan. Offline-capable, privacy-first, no LLM in the decision path.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":4,"created":"2026-08-20T23:25:53Z","updated":"2026-10-06T23:24:52Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://dcondrey.github.io/buildingforgood/","topics":["civic-tech","data-visualization","decision-support","forecasting","hackathon","homelessness","offline-first","python","react","typescript"],"demo":"https://dcondrey.github.io/buildingforgood/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:32:29.922Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T07:32:29.922Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T07:32:29.922Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T06:44:29.198Z","stars":1,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-08T07:32:29.922Z","stars":1,"forks":4}],"technologies":["React","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Decision-support demo for downtown San Diego outreach planning: audits what the unsheltered count actually measured, backtests a forecast honestly, and turns the evidence into an editable, human-owned staff-hour plan. Offline-capable, privacy-first, no LLM in the decision path.","Downtown San Diego's component-derived unsheltered estimate fell 22% in a year on the fixed 261-block panel — but the drop came from tents, not people. On those same blocks, direct observations of people rose 7.5% and appeared on 25 more blocks than the year before. Still Here SD audits that ruler before it becomes a coverage policy: it decomposes the change, backtests a forecast honestly, and turns the evidence into an editable, human-owned outreach plan on a real map of the six downtown neighborhoods.","No logi